1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:01,465
Emma: Hi, good morning!

2
00:00:01,465 --> 00:00:04,065
Jake: Good morning! What can I get for you today?

3
00:00:04,065 --> 00:00:06,375
Emma: I'd like a large latte, please.

4
00:00:06,375 --> 00:00:08,440
Jake: Sure. Hot or iced?

5
00:00:08,440 --> 00:00:11,390
Emma: Hot, please. And could I get oat milk?

6
00:00:11,390 --> 00:00:13,870
Jake: Of course. Anything else?

7
00:00:13,870 --> 00:00:15,790
Emma: Just a blueberry muffin, please.

8
00:00:15,790 --> 00:00:19,085
Jake: That'll be eight dollars fifty. Cash or card?

9
00:00:19,085 --> 00:00:20,240
Emma: Card, please.

10
00:00:20,240 --> 00:00:21,985
Jake: Go ahead and tap when you're ready.

11
00:00:21,985 --> 00:00:23,115
Emma: Thanks so much!

12
00:00:23,115 --> 00:00:25,130
Jake: You're welcome. Have a great day!
